Following the LOL-BO algorithm19, we also periodically update our VAE model jointly and in an end-to-end fashion with the GP surrogate model to encourage the VAE latent space to reorganize such that peptides with similar scores (MICs) are moved closer together and the space becomes more ideal for modelling and optimization. The models are updated jointly using the following loss:\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
