To add this constraint, we adapted the scalable constrained BO algorithm51 to the latent space/generative BO setting. This algorithm works by training a second GP surrogate to model the constraint function \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
